OL,3,GNEWSAPolice examine video of
OL,4,Aanti-migrant activist slashing dinghy
OL,5,Awith knife
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are looking into a video
OL,8,Fappearing to show anti-migrant activist
OL,9,FDaniel Thomas slashing at an inflatable
OL,10,Fboat with a knife in the English
OL,11,FChannel.
OL,13,FThe boat had been carrying about 50
OL,14,Fmigrants who had launched from a beach
OL,15,Fin Normandy. They were picked up by two
OL,16,FRNLI lifeboats once they had reached
OL,17,Fthe UK search and rescue area. They
OL,18,Fwere then transferred to a UK Border
OL,19,FForce vessel and taken to Dover for
OL,20,Fprocessing.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
